1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,100
A robot that lives on your ceiling
一个住在天花板上的机器人，

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,070
just hit number one on Hacker News.
冲上了 Hacker News 第一名。

3
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:05,880
It costs about eight hundred dollars,
它大约八百美元，

4
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:08,200
and it can reach almost every spot in a room.
几乎够得着房间里每个角落。

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,370
No arm. No wheels.
没有手臂，没有轮子，

6
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:10,660
Just four strings.
只有四根绳子。

7
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:11,940
It is called Stringman,
它叫 Stringman（绳子侠），

8
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:15,160
from a tiny company in North Carolina called Neufangled.
来自北卡罗来纳的小公司 Neufangled。

9
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:17,900
On Hacker News it pulled in over eight hundred points,
Hacker News 上它拿了八百多票，

10
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,350
and the comments exploded.
网友吵翻了。

11
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:20,480
Today's brain teaser:
今天的烧脑问题：

12
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:23,790
strings can only pull. So how do they put a robot anywhere?
绳子只能拉，凭啥把机器人送到任何地方？

13
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:24,880
Meet our hero, Grabby,
认识主角：小抓，

14
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:27,510
a little gripper hanging in the middle of the room.
吊在房间正中间的抓手。

15
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:29,710
Four motors sit near the ceiling corners.
天花板四个角各有一台电机，

16
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:31,660
Each one reels a string in or out.
每台收绳或者放绳。

17
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:32,590
Think of a puppet,
像提线木偶，

18
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:34,410
but the puppeteer is four motors.
只不过拉线的是四台电机。

19
00:00:34,410 --> 00:00:35,680
Or a giant claw machine,
或者像一台巨型抓娃娃机，

20
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:37,490
where the whole room is the box.
整间屋子就是那个箱子。

21
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:39,620
Twist one: you cannot push with a string.
反转一：绳子推不动东西。

22
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:41,200
Try it. It just goes floppy.
不信你试试，一推就软了。

23
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:43,150
So every string has to stay tight,
所以每根绳子都得绷紧，

24
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:44,020
all the time.
一刻都不能松。

25
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:44,680
To move left,
想往左走，

26
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:47,680
the left strings reel in, and the right strings let out.
左边收绳，右边放绳。

27
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:48,280
To go down,
想往下走，

28
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,840
all four let out together.
四根一起放。

29
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,900
The controller adjusts every string's pull
控制器每秒调好几十次

30
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:53,250
dozens of times a second.
每根绳子的拉力。

31
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:54,660
Two cameras on the corners
角上的两台摄像头

32
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:57,280
watch a marker on the gripper, like a referee.
盯着抓手上的标记，像裁判一样。

33
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:59,620
That flying camera over a football field?
球场上空飞来飞去的摄像机，

34
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:01,570
It hangs on cables the same way.
也是这样吊在缆绳上的。

35
00:01:01,570 --> 00:01:03,210
Twist two: strings win on reach.
反转二：比够得着，绳子完胜。

36
00:01:03,210 --> 00:01:07,300
The research arm the maker compares it with reaches seventy five centimeters.
厂家拿来对比的研究用机械臂，只能伸七十五厘米。

37
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:09,600
That arm sweeps less than one cubic meter.
那条手臂能扫的空间，不到一立方米；

38
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:12,300
Stringman covers about one hundred forty seven.
绳子侠大约一百四十七立方米。

39
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:15,030
That arm costs about twenty five hundred dollars,
那条手臂大约两千五百美元，

40
00:01:15,030 --> 00:01:16,160
with seven motors.
要七台电机。

41
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:17,410
Stringman: four motors,
绳子侠：四台电机，

42
00:01:17,410 --> 00:01:19,050
about eight hundred dollars.
八百美元左右。

43
00:01:19,050 --> 00:01:20,440
Per dollar, the maker says,
厂家算了一下：每花一块钱，

44
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:22,760
that is about five hundred times more room.
能管的空间多了大约五百倍。

45
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:24,610
It can lift about two kilograms,
而且它能提大约两公斤，

46
00:01:24,610 --> 00:01:26,290
like a big bottle of water.
像一大瓶水。

47
00:01:26,290 --> 00:01:28,610
Why? An arm has to carry its own heavy elbow.
为啥？手臂得扛着自己沉重的胳膊肘，

48
00:01:28,610 --> 00:01:30,320
A string weighs almost nothing.
绳子几乎没有重量。

49
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:31,650
Twist three, the sneakiest:
反转三，最狡猾：

50
00:01:31,650 --> 00:01:34,570
it is strongest in the middle and weakest in the corners.
它在中间最有劲，在角落最没劲。

51
00:01:34,570 --> 00:01:37,030
In the middle, the strings hang almost straight down,
在中间，绳子几乎竖直往下，

52
00:01:37,030 --> 00:01:38,830
so all their pull holds up the load.
力气全用来拎东西。

53
00:01:38,830 --> 00:01:41,240
Near a wall, the strings lie almost flat,
靠近墙边，绳子快躺平了，

54
00:01:41,240 --> 00:01:43,900
and most of the pull goes sideways, wasted.
大部分力气都往旁边白费了。

55
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:46,840
It is like two friends carrying a bag by its handles.
就像两个人一人拎一个提手提袋子：

56
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:49,120
Walk close, easy. Walk far apart, ouch.
挨着走，轻松；离远了，手疼。

57
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:51,840
For safety, each string is capped at twenty eight newtons,
为了安全，每根绳子最多拉二十八牛，

58
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:53,890
about the weight of a three kilogram bag.
差不多三公斤东西的重量。

59
00:01:53,890 --> 00:01:55,140
So the corners of the room
所以房间的角落，

60
00:01:55,140 --> 00:01:56,620
are where it struggles most.
就是它最吃力的地方。

61
00:01:56,620 --> 00:01:58,580
Its brain runs on your own computer,
大脑跑在你自己的电脑上，

62
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:01,110
and the maker says no data leaves your home.
厂家说，数据不出家门。

63
00:02:01,110 --> 00:02:02,850
You teach it a chore by showing it.
你做几遍给它看，它就能学；

64
00:02:02,850 --> 00:02:05,750
The maker says fifty demos can be enough for some tasks.
厂家说有些活五十次示范就够。

65
00:02:05,750 --> 00:02:08,000
Fine print: these numbers come from the maker,
友情提示：这些数字都来自厂家，

66
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,710
and nobody has tested them in your messy living room.
还没人在你家乱糟糟的客厅里测过。

67
00:02:10,710 --> 00:02:12,910
Also, four strings across your living room?
还有，客厅里拉四根绳子，

68
00:02:12,910 --> 00:02:14,410
Your cat may have opinions.
你家的猫可能有意见。

69
00:02:14,410 --> 00:02:16,100
So how do strings that only pull
所以，只能拉的绳子，

70
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:17,330
put a robot anywhere?
凭啥把机器人送到任何地方？

71
00:02:17,330 --> 00:02:18,780
Four of them play tug of war,
四根绳子互相拔河，

72
00:02:18,780 --> 00:02:21,350
and the robot sits right where the pulls balance.
机器人就停在力量平衡的那一点。

73
00:02:21,350 --> 00:02:22,930
Sometimes the best robot arm
有时候最聪明的机械臂，

74
00:02:22,930 --> 00:02:24,240
is no arm at all.
就是根本没有手臂。

